``` Lab 02 - one source touching >=20 distinct ports on one host within 5 min. Uses the CIM Network_Traffic data model (pfSense/OPNsense, iptables, Zeek conn). ```
| tstats summariesonly=false dc(All_Traffic.dest_port) as distinct_ports count as attempts values(All_Traffic.action) as actions
    from datamodel=Network_Traffic by _time span=5m All_Traffic.src All_Traffic.dest
| rename All_Traffic.* as *
| where distinct_ports >= 20
| sort - distinct_ports
